From: pbs05 <27010143+pbs05@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 14:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: disconnect PHY after shared QDMA teardown

The Airoha driver tears down the shared QDMA ring at the end of
airoha_dev_stop(). Disconnect the PHY after that teardown completes.

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
@@ -1971,6 +1971,8 @@ static int airoha_dev_stop(struct net_de
 		}
 	}
 
+	phylink_disconnect_phy(dev->phylink);
+
 	return 0;
 }
 
